    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i><u>CORKSCREW: THE ONLY GAME OF IT'S KIND.</u></i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Have you ever found a game with all of the following:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Randomly Generated Level Layouts, for a fresh dynamic game every time you want another round!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >HD Artstyle, reminiscent of a cartoon or anime, giving a genre that is usually Pixel-Art a lick of fresh paint.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Momentum-Based Physics, the player is capable of going as fast as you are willing to make it go! The physics are reminiscent of <i><span class=\"bb_strike\">another game series with a fast main character.</span></i></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crass Humour, with or without voice acting <strong><span class=\"bb_strike\">(#knowingsmile)</span></strong>, the expressions and actions of the characters along will be enough to get a giggle or 2 out of you!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CORKSCREW</strong>\u00a0sets you in Rural England in the year 2019, where you play as a young 10 year old lad who's work is <i>rudely</i> interrupted by a weird kid from his school <i><span class=\"bb_strike\">(he's the guy in the game with a cat-face stuck to his face like a mask, dodgy guy lmao)</span></i>, who has used the power of evil <i>(and having a fetish)</i> to take over his small nation! And getting under the young lad's skin by taking the one thing he loves the most, his <strong>Cash! </strong>The Player must traverse the levels to not only grab back his cash, but to give this weird kid a right walloping!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i><u>CORKSCREW: THE ONLY GAME OF IT'S KIND.</u></i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Have you ever found a game with all of the following:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Randomly Generated Level Layouts, for a fresh dynamic game every time you want another round!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >HD Artstyle, reminiscent of a cartoon or anime, giving a genre that is usually Pixel-Art a lick of fresh paint.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Momentum-Based Physics, the player is capable of going as fast as you are willing to make it go! The physics are reminiscent of <i><span class=\"bb_strike\">another game series with a fast main character.</span></i></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crass Humour, with or without voice acting <strong><span class=\"bb_strike\">(#knowingsmile)</span></strong>, the expressions and actions of the characters along will be enough to get a giggle or 2 out of you!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CORKSCREW</strong>\u00a0sets you in Rural England in the year 2019, where you play as a young 10 year old lad who's work is <i>rudely</i> interrupted by a weird kid from his school <i><span class=\"bb_strike\">(he's the guy in the game with a cat-face stuck to his face like a mask, dodgy guy lmao)</span></i>, who has used the power of evil <i>(and having a fetish)</i> to take over his small nation! And getting under the young lad's skin by taking the one thing he loves the most, his <strong>Cash! </strong>The Player must traverse the levels to not only grab back his cash, but to give this weird kid a right walloping!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
